\newlabel{fig:cs137_isc}{{4.4}{81}{Short-circuit current $I_{\rm SC}$ of the Cs$_{0.1}$FA$_{0.9}$PbI$_3$ module as a function of time during insertion into and withdrawal from the $^{137}$Cs irradiator (dose rate = 44.16~rad\,hr$^{-1}$ in perovskite). The step changes in $I_{\rm SC}$ provide an unambiguous current-mode detection signal}{figure.4.4}{}}
